[{"client_msg_id":"f2763bd9-1c21-44b3-a733-630a21baaec9","type":"message","user":"U01U44T1FK2","text":"公開VPN入れた\n不安定要素なし","ts":"1621597436.054100","thread_ts":"1621597436.054100","edited":{"user":"U01U44T1FK2","ts":"1621597645.000000"},"reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AHMm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bac2a120-99ef-4875-a947-f9c64e8df3e8","type":"message","user":"U01U44T1FK2","text":"~公開VPNにすら繋がらなかった~\n~これはAndroidのせい説が濃厚かな~\nVPNタイプミスってた","ts":"1621597024.053400","edited":{"user":"U01U44T1FK2","ts":"1621597249.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"totemoturai","count":4,"users":["U06ECBRTJ","U8CC7MDCL","U81LLJ340","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4F7b6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1f8b6a18-b967-43c2-811a-8c3f1363b429","type":"message","user":"U01U44T1FK2","text":"\u0026gt; 筑波大とかの公開VPNに繋いでみて比較するとかありかもですね\nなるほど、別のVPNに繋いでみる作戦か\nExpressVPNを契約しているのでそっち使ってみてそもそもこの端末とVPNと相性悪いのか検証してみたいと思います\nありがとうございます","ts":"1621587501.052600","edited":{"user":"U01U44T1FK2","ts":"1621587950.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=KQP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1b9f089d-708f-472d-bcce-e1a31a9ecd4d","type":"message","user":"UNJ2DANJC","text":"筑波大とかの公開VPNに繋いでみて比較するとかありかもですね","ts":"1621585940.050800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dtTkt"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U02269AAADD","text":"\u003c@U02269AAADD\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1621584134.050600","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"d00994ab-7d39-4e47-91c8-4c0727a04717","type":"message","user":"U01U44T1FK2","text":"\u0026gt; ちなみに会社で推奨される設定とソフトなんですよね?\n\u0026gt; としたら会社のシス管に連絡したほうがいいんじゃ?\n```我々はサポート専属要員では無い\nVPN提供側のせいとも言いきれない\nソフトウェアレベルの細かい対応はできない\n(つまりおま環は対応できない)```\nというふうな回答をいただいたのと、そもそもスマホでの接続実績が殆ど無いので自分で調べてるところです\n\n\n\u0026gt; Android はデフォで設定からVPNつなげるから、それ使ってるんじゃないかとエスパー\nエスパーがいた。デフォのVPN使ってますねー","ts":"1621582623.050200","edited":{"user":"U01U44T1FK2","ts":"1621597523.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"R3A"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6aca404e-8a41-4d09-9a61-b8cfbfd13c3e","type":"message","user":"U8CC7MDCL","text":"pixel3はl2tp keepalive使えないから駄目とかなんとか。\nルーター側のログになんか出てそうなきはしますが会社で確認してもらうのもありかもしれません\n\nとエスパー","ts":"1621582554.049400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PT2y"}]},{"client_msg_id":"010db9f2-9157-4552-8331-50f5a4878f5d","type":"message","user":"U8CC7MDCL","text":"症状的にはpmtud ブラックホールみがあるけどいうてandroidってMTUの値変えられないしなぁ…\n\n\u003chttps://support.google.com/pixelphone/thread/9735259/vpn%E3%81%8C%E6%A9%9F%E8%83%BD%E3%81%97%E3%81%BE%E3%81%9B%E3%82%93?hl=ja\u0026amp;msgid=16837004|https://support.google.com/pixelphone/thread/9735259/vpn%E3%81%8C%E6%A9%9F%E8%83%BD%E3%81%97%E3%81%BE%E3%81%9B%E3%82%93?hl=ja\u0026amp;msgid=16837004\u003e","ts":"1621582347.046200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"h6Ka"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bf849377-053b-4120-9d4b-f39d911f7930","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"Android はデフォで設定からVPNつなげるから、それ使ってるんじゃないかとエスパー","ts":"1621582313.045900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IXi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8bdd0106-69e5-45d4-ae89-4dcd71e5bc73","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"ちなみに会社で推奨される設定とソフトなんですよね?\nとしたら会社のシス管に連絡したほうがいいんじゃ?","ts":"1621582248.044900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Muh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c8c55d0d-7306-4036-a477-52e6e07ba63c","type":"message","user":"U01U44T1FK2","text":"いまはこんな原因を妄想してます\n```Android10以上?\nパケットが届いてない?```","ts":"1621582056.042500","edited":{"user":"U01U44T1FK2","ts":"1621582069.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RDkw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e3e16fc9-60a6-4e6e-99d8-d1141ae1baaf","type":"message","user":"U01U44T1FK2","text":"そうです\nそこら辺忘れてた\n```L2TP/IPSec PSK```","ts":"1621581956.041800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"d9c"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fffa4302-8bcb-45a1-8284-77266740f3f3","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"つながる事があるってことは設定は間違ってないんだろうなぁ","ts":"1621581930.041500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"V7AwH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"36e3e4c6-5a0d-4b8e-846f-acb1b56dfa45","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"あと、L2TPですかね？","ts":"1621581898.040600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Bjz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dc97f2de-5e85-4c44-ad40-950348f038d4","type":"message","user":"U01U44T1FK2","text":"VPN全然知らないからエスパーにしかわからない質問になっちゃいますね\nとりあえずVPNの設定調べて再投します","ts":"1621581876.040300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Yg="}]},{"client_msg_id":"672e0e9b-a889-428c-ba58-e9bc0fa839d8","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"まぁ、この質問はエスパーにしかならないかと…","ts":"1621581767.039000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"p5U"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b1c14fda-174a-473d-ab22-c60cd19bae95","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"1. 会社のVPNのキャパオーバー\n2. 会社のVPNが 1つの Global IPから受け付けるセッション数が決まってる","ts":"1621581753.038600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NbNn9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"098e3b7f-e301-4bb9-8ea4-c13c026b4558","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"エスパーでもうしわけないのですが、UDP系の接続設定がTCP系に変更できるなら、やってみるとか?\n最初からほとんどだめ、かつまれにOKだとUDPのNATの穴空けの都合な気がした","ts":"1621581727.038100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FO7nQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2cb1affe-4cec-432b-b6b0-c8abfdf13cfd","type":"message","user":"U01U44T1FK2","text":"```質問\n---\nVPN不安定のときに疑う項目って何がありますか?```\n```概要\n---\nvpnの神がいたら教えていただきたい\n会社のvpnにandroidを繋げようとするんですがとてつもなく不安定です\n\n接続状況\n---\n自宅のwifi: 2分くらいしたら切断、その後は再起動しないと再接続できない\n有線LAN: 2分くらいしたら切断、その後は再起動しないと再接続できない```\n```Env\n---\nPixel3、Android11\n個人で持ってるAndroid10端末\nL2TP/IPSec PSK\n* Ubuntuデスクトップ(有線)、iPadPro iOS14.4.2(Wifi)では安定して接続します```","ts":"1621581538.035600","edited":{"user":"U01U44T1FK2","ts":"1621582168.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CkNSD"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U01UVCK03CL","text":"\u003c@U01UVCK03CL\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1621580101.031800","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":"\u003c@UD1FQV38V\u003e has left the channel","ts":"1621569081.031600","subtype":"channel_leave","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"type":"message","user":"U023ANT1TME","text":"\u003c@U023ANT1TME\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1621568681.031300","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"type":"message","user":"U022641QPUP","text":"\u003c@U022641QPUP\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1621561436.031000","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"type":"message","user":"U022LNF6VDZ","text":"\u003c@U022LNF6VDZ\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1621550539.030700","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"e407c929-a299-441c-863c-9140493f7